      "content": "Specification of the PrintNode cloud and remote printing API. PrintNode lets web and server applications print to physical printers through the PrintNode Client running on a remote computer. All requests use HTTP Basic authentication with the API key supplied as the username and an empty password.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: PrintNode Support",
